            <span class="eyebrow">The real problem</span>
            <h2>It's context, privacy, and judgment — not a device fix.</h2>
            <p class="lede">IT support fixes devices. The problem here is different: in a dispute, the question is what your digital life reveals, who can use it, and what is safe to change and when. That takes judgment under pressure, discretion, and an understanding of the whole picture — not a fix for one device.</p>
