<section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="head">
            <span class="eyebrow">Why not a relative</span>
            <h2>Why your tech-savvy nephew is not the right call.</h2>
            <p class="lede">A relative may know technology, but that isn't the issue. Informal help can miss the wider picture, make a partial or mistimed change, or — in a serious dispute — learn private things you'd rather they didn't, turning a sensitive matter into family knowledge. In safety-sensitive cases, the wrong change at the wrong time can escalate risk.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

